<title>AUSTRALIA: Citibank's Australia unit to cut 300 staff.</title>
<headline>Citibank's Australia unit to cut 300 staff.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank Ltd, the Australian unit of Citicorp, said on Friday that up to 300 employees from the retail operations would be made redundant following a strategic review which was continuing.</p>
<p>Citibank said it was one of many local banks which had been forced to reassess their position to remain competitive in the marketplace. It said it was reviewing its situation and would take steps to raise its performance.</p>
<p>&quot;The strategic review has not been finalised, however, it is expected that up to 300 employees in the retail bank will be made redundant nationally.&quot; -- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
